      "topic": "Solar System",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "It may be generated by collisions within the asteroid belt brought on by gravitational interactions with the planets; a more recent proposed origin is materials from planet Mars.The outer Solar System hosts a cosmic dust cloud.It extends from about 10 AU to about 40 AU, and was probably created by collisions within the Kuiper belt.",
