      "topic": "Sun",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "The zone is so named because thermal radiation is the primary means of energy transfer: photons scatter from dense gas so often that they take a million years to cross this zone.The temperature drops from approximately 7 million to 2 million kelvins with increasing distance from the core.",
