      "orginal_content": "Kelvin and Hermann von Helmholtz proposed a gravitational contraction mechanism to explain the energy output, but the resulting age estimate was only 20 million years, well short of the time span of at least 300 million years suggested by some geological discoveries of that time.In 1890, Lockyer proposed a meteoritic hypothesis for the formation and evolution of the Sun.",
