      "topic": "Sun",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "In 1980, the Solar Maximum Mission probes were launched by NASA.This spacecraft was designed to observe gamma rays, X-rays and ultraviolet radiation from solar flares during a time of high solar activity and solar luminosity.",
