      "topic": "Sun",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "Religious aspects Solar deities play a major role in many religions and mythologies.Worship of the Sun was central to civilisations such as the ancient Egyptians, the Inca of South America and the Aztecs of what is now Mexico.In Hinduism, the Sun is still considered a god, known as Surya (Sanskrit: \u0938\u0942\u0930\u094d\u092f).",
