        "Tidal Force Impact on Earth's Rotation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c853c41b-9045-4cf4-9095-582a7c7866d9",
      "topic": "Moon",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "3.2 billion years ago, during the Archean, the solar day was only around 13 hours.",
      "headers": [
