      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "Because the distance between the Moon and Earth is very slowly increasing over time, the angular diameter of the Moon is decreasing.As it evolves toward becoming a red giant, the size of the Sun, and its apparent diameter in the sky, are slowly increasing.",
