      "id": "57484428-3aea-4bdb-8e84-ecfce4e999a9",
      "topic": "Mars",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "A number of authors have suggested that their formation process involves liquid water, probably from melting ice, although others have argued for formation mechanisms involving carbon dioxide frost or the movement of dry dust.",
