      "topic": "Space Exploration",
      "source": "Space & Astronomy_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "Voyager 2 studied the planet's unique atmosphere and magnetosphere.Voyager 2 also examined its ring system and the moons of Uranus including all five of the previously known moons, while discovering an additional ten previously unknown moons.Images of Uranus proved to have a uniform appearance, with no evidence of the dramatic storms or atmospheric banding evident on Jupiter and Saturn.Great effort was required to even identify a few clouds in the images of the planet.",
