      "id": "69574986-f9c5-4a7d-90e7-210471d5b8f5",
      "topic": "Biology",
      "source": "Science_wikipedia",
      "orginal_content": "Cell biology Cell biology is the branch of biology that studies the structure, function, and behaviour of cells.Bioenergetics is a field in biochemistry and cell biology that concerns energy flow through living systems.This is an active area of biological research that includes the study of the transformation of energy in living organisms and the study of thousands of different cellular processes such as cellular respiration and other metabolic and enzymatic processes that enable the use of energy.",
      "headers": [
